@startuml US109-SSD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
participant ":System" as SYS

autonumber

BO -> SYS : updateAirportStatus(\n  iataCode,\n  newStatus )

SYS --> BO : 200 OK\n( updated Airport resource + HATEOAS links )

note over SYS
  [Validates iataCode format — 3 uppercase letters]
  [Looks up Airport aggregate by IATACode]
  [Validates newStatus is a legal value:
   Operational | Closed | Under Maintenance]
  [Enforces state transition rules: all transitions between distinct states allowed;
   same-state transitions rejected with 409 Conflict]
  [Replaces AirportStatus on Airport entity]
  [Detects concurrent modification via optimistic locking (@Version)]
  [Persists updated Airport aggregate]
end note

@enduml
